{
  "source": "Prompts/unexpected-results-v4.mp4",
  "duration": 168.0426875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.04,
      "text": "Everyone has opinions about AI's future, whether they're AI warriors or AI optimists."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.58,
      "end": 11.44,
      "text": "No matter how confident those people are, some of the biggest results in any massive shift"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.44,
      "end": 12.98,
      "text": "are things no one predicted."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.9,
      "end": 17.44,
      "text": "The best way to see it is a true story from 1902 Hanoi."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.02,
      "end": 19.32,
      "text": "The city had a big problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.04,
      "end": 22.12,
      "text": "Their new sewer system was overrun with rats."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.04,
      "end": 24.54,
      "text": "They devised a perfect plan."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.98,
      "end": 29.24,
      "text": "Hunters simply turn in a severed rat's tail and they collect a cash payment."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.8,
      "end": 31.62,
      "text": "Tails poured in by the thousands."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.32,
      "end": 36.66,
      "text": "Based strictly on the volume of tails collected, the brilliance of the plan was obvious."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.4,
      "end": 39.38,
      "text": "The system appeared to be functioning flawlessly."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.42,
      "end": 42.1,
      "text": "Then people saw something very strange."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.0,
      "end": 44.8,
      "text": "Rats running around the city with no tails."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.66,
      "end": 46.38,
      "text": "Here's what happened."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.28,
      "end": 52.54,
      "text": "Rats can live a relatively full rat life even without their tails and keep having more rat babies."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.13,
      "end": 56.78,
      "text": "The rat hunters came up with a clever plan to keep the tail supply strong."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.38,
      "end": 60.18,
      "text": "They clipped the tails for the payment, but let the rats live."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.88,
      "end": 61.9,
      "text": "A dead rat pays once."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.82,
      "end": 64.36,
      "text": "A live rat pays forever."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.08,
      "end": 69.08,
      "text": "Some rat entrepreneurs went even further and started dedicated rat farms."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.7,
      "end": 73.64,
      "text": "When Hanoi finally stopped the program, they had a mountain of rat tails,"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.04,
      "end": 75.56,
      "text": "but more rats than when it started."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.34,
      "end": 78.68,
      "text": "The payment system worked exactly as designed."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.26,
      "end": 81.5,
      "text": "People delivered tails and the government paid them."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.96,
      "end": 86.92,
      "text": "But the real goal was fewer rats and the program encouraged people to keep rats alive."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.74,
      "end": 89.86,
      "text": "Once you see that shape, you find it everywhere."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.92,
      "end": 96.42,
      "text": "SMS text messaging was originally designed as a narrow, basic service to pass short notes"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.42,
      "end": 97.6,
      "text": "across mobile networks."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.38,
      "end": 101.56,
      "text": "Those early phones were built almost entirely for voice calls."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.32,
      "end": 107.4,
      "text": "But users took that secondary, short form feature and turned it into their primary method"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.4,
      "end": 111.44,
      "text": "of communication, creating the foundational backbone of traditional texting."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.98,
      "end": 115.18,
      "text": "Australia imported cane toads to eat beetles destroying sugar cane."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.7,
      "end": 119.92,
      "text": "They barely controlled the pests, poisoned native animals, and spread across the country."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.42,
      "end": 122.04,
      "text": "The biggest results were never the plan."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.52,
      "end": 123.88,
      "text": "Now point that history at AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.6,
      "end": 130.04,
      "text": "Every AI expert, optimist, and warrior alike is making a prediction about the future."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.84,
      "end": 134.6,
      "text": "The most important thing AI does in your lifetime, good or bad,"
    },
    {
      "start": 134.6,
      "end": 139.76,
      "text": "may be something nobody in any camp, any lab, or any course has thought of yet."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.5,
      "end": 142.12,
      "text": "That's not a reason to fear the future."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.74,
      "end": 145.98,
      "text": "It's the reason to walk into it curious, with your eyes open."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.76,
      "end": 148.9,
      "text": "You do not need to predict the future perfectly."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.66,
      "end": 153.28,
      "text": "You need to recognize uncertainty, watch what people actually do,"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.7,
      "end": 156.58,
      "text": "and build skills that still matter when the forecast changes."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.44,
      "end": 159.96,
      "text": "Some of the biggest results are the ones nobody predicted."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.74,
      "end": 162.56,
      "text": "That's the best reason to stay curious."
    }
  ],
